Package: livecaption
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ffmpeg, avahi-daemon, avahi-utils, adduser, systemd
Recommends: comitup
Suggests: jq
Homepage: https://github.com/@REPO@
Description: Live captions from a soundboard feed to every screen in the room
 Streams audio from a capture device to a speech-to-text service and serves
 the resulting captions as a web page on the local network, advertised over
 mDNS so viewers can reach it by name with no app to install.
 .
 Installed as a system service configured from /etc/default/livecaption.
